{% if has_scene_audio %}
### Audio

Generated clips live under `Assets/Resources/Audio/<cue>/`. **SceneAudio.cs**
discovers them at runtime — no manual wiring:

- each scene starts its best name-matched ambient bed (e.g. a `*wind*` /
  `*interior*` clip whose name shares words with the scene), plus one global
  music bed;
- gameplay scripts fire one-shots with `SceneAudio.Play("flare")` — fuzzy
  name match, so partial cue names work;
- clips added later (re-running the audio stage) are picked up automatically.
{% if audio_tracks %}

Authored cue intents from the schema:
