- `{{ t.name }}` — {{ t.description }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if has_atmosphere %}
### Atmosphere

This concept implies a real sky, so the vendored **URP-Atmosphere** scattering
feature (MIT, sinnwrig — license in `Assets/Atmosphere/LICENSE.md`) ships and
self-wires: planet surface at the scene origin, your directional light drives
the scattering. Tune via the `_Atmosphere` object spawned at Play, or edit
`Assets/Resources/Atmosphere/DefaultAtmosphereProfile.asset`.
{% endif %}

