## Controls

{% if locomotion == "fly" %}
Flight controller: **WASD / left stick** to steer, pitch with the vertical
axis; see the player controller script for dive/boost bindings.
{% elif locomotion == "drive" %}
Vehicle controller: **W/S** throttle & brake, **A/D** steer; handbrake and
camera bindings are in the controller script.
{% elif locomotion == "swim" %}
Swim controller: **WASD** to swim, vertical axis to ascend/descend.
{% else %}
Character controller: **WASD / left stick** to move, **Space** to jump.
{% endif %}
{% if "input_system" in features %}
Bindings live in `Assets/Settings/{{ project_name }}InputActions.inputactions`
(New Input System) — edit them there, not in code.
{% endif %}

## Next Steps (specific to this build)

{% if entities and has_procedural_entities %}
- Procedural groups (see table) render generated meshes — replace with real
