{% endif %}
{% if "navmesh" in features %}
- **NavMesh**: AI uses NavMesh — bake via **Window → AI → Navigation → Bake**
  after any level-geometry change.
{% endif %}
{% if story_beats %}
- Story beats ({{ story_beats | length }}) trigger through the DialogueManager —
  extend `Assets/Scripts/DialogueManager.cs` for presentation.
{% endif %}
- Drop your own assets into `Assets/_UserAssets/` (categorized skeleton with
  per-folder notes).
- Regenerate anytime with
  `python main.py unity-validate {{ project_name }}.schema.json` — edits to the
  schema sidecar (entity `model_hint`s, scene moods) re-compile deterministically
  without re-running the LLM.
